%Y A399527 Cf. A005117, A399526.
%Y A399527 Examples of p-rough numbers: A000027 (p=2), A005408 (p=3), A007310 (p=3), A007775 (p=7), A008364 (p=11).
%Y A399527 Cf. A007675 (p=2), A398951 (p=3), A398953 (p=5).
